Spoilers on wishing follow...


The way I understand it you are only allowed 3 "units" per wish.  That
includes blessings and rustproofs.  For instance, wishing for
"the blessed rustproof +1 vorpal blade" is 3 units.  If you wish for
much higher than +1 then you're likely to receive only a +0 sword.
You can simply wish for "the +3 vorpal blade" if you prefer, and will
probably get it.

However, based on your luck it is possible to get higher-rated stuff.
I like to play it safe though.  I hate wasting a wish.

This is why your first wish from a wand of wishing is always
"2 blessed scrolls of charging."

